# Title: Visual Studio Code Tunnel Execution
# ID: 90d6bd71-dffb-4989-8d86-a827fedd6624
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems), citron_ninja
# Date: 2023-10-25
# Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.t1071.001, attack.t1219
# Description: Detects Visual Studio Code tunnel execution. Attackers can abuse this functionality to establish a C2 channel
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((NOT process_name=* AND process_exec="*.exe tunnel") OR (parent_process_exec="* tunnel" AND process_path="*\\cmd.exe" AND (process_exec="*/d /c *" AND process_exec="*\\servers\\Stable-*" AND process_exec="*code-server.cmd*")) OR ((process_exec="*.exe tunnel*" AND process_exec="*--accept-server-license-terms*")))
